      "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:38:53.343Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey, I face a similar issue. To customize it, this is the idea which I have in my mind:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Create a new-field in Item line called <code>TDS Rate</code>.</li>\n<li>Then, when the invoice is submitted, invoke a script to calculate net tds payable.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>But before implementing, I would like to validate my idea. Is this approach a correct one? Or is there a better approach?</p>",
